 not the $1.30 it was in 1998 or the measly quarter you probably got as a k=
id.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Now, the dreamtime dentist is staying current=
 with a digital transformation through <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com=
/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWD6WQ8rzjHYVCHBt833JBN4W2L--MX5JFmqfN4vJDLM2-ZW0W=
