33" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"splKztvp" target=3D"_blank"=
>Tooth Fairy Tracker</a> =E2=80=94 a website that makes the whimsical tradi=
tion more digitally connected and oral care a bit more magical.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold; font-size: =
18px;">How it works</span></p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">After a kid loses a tooth, parents can enter their ema=
il and child=E2=80=99s name on the website to receive updates from Kiki, AK=
A the tooth fairy, as she begins her journey to collect the tooth =E2=80=94=
 no account or app needed. Updates include selfies, videos, and make-believ=
e insights like flight speed.<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Evening updates, founder Oliver Finel <a href=3D"https=
://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWD6WQ8rzjHYVCHBt833JBN4W2L--M=
X5JFmqfN4vJDLM2-ZW0W7Y8-PT6lZ3msW7dmyjj8qRsRdW1VgmQd8M7JcxVQ4NFV3pLJlBW1FC0=
